Some more great news from the first week of Leagues IV: there isn’t anything else that needs changing! While we’re keeping our eye out for potential improvements, for the most part it seems like you’re all having a fantastic time unlocking new regions, ticking off tasks, and piling up points.

As a reminder, please note that your League Point totals may not be 100% up-to-date in the main game Leagues Rewards Shop. This is because your total updates periodically to prevent our systems becoming overloaded. If you’re experiencing this issue, don’t panic – just give it a little while to catch up.

